The QGIS package provides CMake targets:

    find_package(Qgis REQUIRED)

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Qgis::core Qgis::gui Qgis::analysis)

Available targets:
    Qgis::core       - QGIS core library
    Qgis::gui        - QGIS GUI library
    Qgis::analysis   - QGIS analysis library
    Qgis::app        - QGIS application (if desktop feature is enabled)

Features:
    3d          - Enable 3D support with Qt3D
    server      - Enable QGIS Server components
    bindings    - Build Python bindings (requires Python)
    gui         - Build GUI components (requires Qt widgets)
    desktop     - Build desktop application
    postgis     - Enable PostgreSQL/PostGIS support
    spatialite  - Enable SpatiaLite support
    oracle      - Enable Oracle database support
    sfcgal      - Enable SFCGAL geometry support
    pdal        - Enable PDAL point cloud support
    grass       - Enable GRASS GIS support
    test        - Enable test suite

Example usage with features:
    vcpkg install qgis[desktop,gui,3d,postgis]